    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Studio Lennarts & De Bruijn (S.L&DB), The Hague, Netherlands. Founded 2015 by Max Lennarts and Menno de Bruijn; 2-person partnership with internship positions. Dutch Design Award-winning studio (\"Stay Sane Stay Safe\" campaign), featured in The Guardian, PrintMag and It's Nice That. Work spans brand identities, campaigns, websites, exhibitions, publications, animations and illustration -- self-described as 'post-multidisciplinary'. Clients include cultural institutions (KM21 Museum, Monopole Museum), fashion (Bershka), and music/events (Appelsap Festival). Fully autonomous creative studio; Autonomy 5 (runs as an independent studio, sets its own direction). Work Status = Studio confirmed from their own site and LinkedIn (company type: Partnership, founded 2015, actively trading with 2026 copyright on site).",
